{
  "name": "Aura of Conquest (Oath of Conquest)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You constantly emanate a menacing aura while you're not Incapacitated. The aura extends 10 feet from you in every direction, but not through total cover.</p><p>Any creature of your choice that starts its turn in the aura takes psychic damage equal to your Charisma modifier. If that creature is Frightened, this damage is doubled. Additionally, any creature in the aura that is Frightened, has its Speed reduced to 0.</p><p>At 18th level, the range of this aura increases to 30 feet.</p>",
